#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:6
msgid "# PostgreSQL Setup and Operations"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:10
msgid ""
"> FreeAnima uses PostgreSQL for conversation archives, semantic memory, self "
"layer, and related data.  > Related concepts: [`memory.md`](../concepts/"
"memory.md), [`sleep.md`](../concepts/sleep.md).  > Security and credentials: "
"[`security.md`](security.md)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:12
msgid "## Connection Configuration"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:14
msgid "Set the database URL in `config.yaml`:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:21
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```yaml\n"
"database:\n"
"  url: postgresql://user:pass@localhost:5432/anima\n"
"  # or inject from pass:\n"
"  # url: pass:services/postgres/anima\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:23
msgid ""
"Production **must** set `database.url`. Prefer pass for passwords instead of "
"plaintext in config. Path conventions: [`security.md`]"
"(security.md#credential-responsibilities)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:25
msgid "## Local Install (Debian)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:29
msgid ""
"```bash # Install PostgreSQL, create anima db/user (requires sudo)  sudo ./"
"scripts/setup-postgres-debian.sh"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:32
msgid ""
"# Write credentials to pass (script prints anima credential add …)  anima "
"credential add services/postgres/anima url=… host=… password=… database=anima"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:36
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# config.yaml:\n"
"#   url: pass:services/postgres/anima\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:38
msgid ""
"Defaults: PostgreSQL 17, `localhost` only, `scram-sha-256`, dedicated "
"`anima` database and user."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:40
msgid "## Extensions (One-Time)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:42
msgid ""
"Full-text and vector search require PostgreSQL extensions. The app user "
"usually cannot `CREATE EXTENSION`; run as superuser:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:47
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```bash\n"
"sudo apt install postgresql-17-pgvector   # match psql --version\n"
"sudo -u postgres psql -d anima -f storage/db/scripts/ensure-pg-extensions.sql\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:49
msgid ""
"Fresh Debian installs via `setup-postgres-debian.sh` handle extensions "
"automatically."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:51
msgid "## Schema Migrations"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/database.md:54
msgid ""
"**Production (recommended):** When PostgreSQL is configured, `anima service` "
"**auto-applies** pending schema migrations on startup."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/database.md:54
msgid "**Manual:**"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:59
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```bash\n"
"DATABASE_URL=\"$(anima credential get services/postgres/anima url)\" \\\n"
"  bun run --filter @freeanima/storage-db db:migrate\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:61
msgid "Run after extensions are installed, or restart `anima service`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:63
msgid "## Backups"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/database.md:67
msgid ""
"**Migrations do not replace backups** — schedule regular full backups (e.g. "
"`pg_dump`)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/database.md:67
msgid "Back up before destructive changes."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/guide/database.md:67
msgid ""
"Include `~/.anima/` (`FREEANIMA_HOME` overridable) in backup policy — see "
"[`security.md`](security.md#data-persistence)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:69
msgid "## Integration Tests (Developers)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:71
msgid ""
"Full integration tests require **Docker** for a temporary PostgreSQL "
"instance:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:76
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```bash\n"
"bun run test:integration\n"
"bun run test              # unit + integration in parallel\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:78
msgid "pre-commit `test:changed` does **not** run integration tests."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:80
msgid "## Troubleshooting"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:86
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Symptom                     | Check                                                          |\n"
"| --------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Service fails on DB connect | `database.url`; PostgreSQL running; pass credentials readable  |\n"
"| Migration fails             | Extensions installed; DB user has DDL privileges               |\n"
"| FTS / vector recall empty   | `ensure-pg-extensions.sql` applied; `embedding` config enabled |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/guide/database.md:87
msgid "More deployment security: [`security.md`](security.md)."
msgstr ""
